        "response": {
          "bodySize": 5577,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 5577,
            "text": "{\"total_occurrences\":1,\"occurrences\":[{\"id\":\"68a489af0ad3d3561a5ad5be\",\"event_title\":\"High School Musical Movie 2 Bottomless Brunch Party!\",\"start_time\":\"12:00\",\"end_time\":\"16:15\",\"date\":\"2025-11-15\",\"end_date\":\"2025-11-15\",\"is_sold_out\":false,\"cancelled\":false,\"sell_until\":\"2025-11-15 11:00:00\",\"sell_from\":\"2025-10-29 03:37:01\",\"total_tickets_ever_available\":20,\"total_ticket_attendees\":4,\"ticket_type_groups\":[],\"ticket_types\":[{\"id\":\"68a488c70ad3d3541a59470d\",\"name\":\"Table Seating Incl Bottomless (Unreserved)\",\"description\":\"<p>TICKET INCLUDES ENTRY FOR 1 PERSON ON A SEATED BEER FESTIVAL OR CABARET STYLE TABLE.</p><p>ALL TABLES SEAT 4-10 PEOPLE. PLEASE NOTE, YOU MAY BE SHARING WITH OTHERS DEPENDING ON YOUR PARTY SIZE.</p><p>SEATING IS UNALLOCATED / FIRST-COME-FIRST-SERVED - PLEASE ARRIVE ALL TOGETHER TO HAVE MORE CHANCE OF BEING SAT WITH YOUR GROUP.</p><p>TICKET INCLUDES ACCESS TO THE BOTTOMLESS, WHICH STARTS APPROX 1/2 HOUR AFTER DOORS OPEN.</p><p>LAST ENTRY 30 MINS AFTER DOORS OPEN.</p><p>TICKET DOES NOT INCLUDE FOOD, WE HAVE LOADS OF HOT BEIGE GOODNESS (NACHOS, HOT DOGS &amp; VEGAN OPTIONS).</p><p>INCLUDES £1 RESTORATION LEVY.</p>\",\"start_time\":\"12:00\",\"end_time\":\"16:15\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":20,\"remaining_quantity\":16,\"min_per_transaction\":0,\"max_per_transaction\":10,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2025-11-15 11:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":2275,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":false,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":20,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":4,\"total_ticket_attendees\":4,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":227,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}}]}],\"event\":{\"title\":\"High School Musical Movie 2 Bottomless Brunch Party!\",\"photos\":[{\"_id\":\"68c7da62d