        "response": {
          "bodySize": 9486,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 9486,
            "text": "{\"total_occurrences\":1,\"occurrences\":[{\"id\":\"6785128e5acf17361209c42c\",\"event_title\":\"Labyrinth Movie Night & Mini Bowie Disco\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"date\":\"2026-01-09\",\"end_date\":\"2026-01-09\",\"is_sold_out\":false,\"cancelled\":false,\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":\"2025-10-29 17:16:48\",\"total_tickets_ever_available\":144,\"total_ticket_attendees\":40,\"ticket_type_groups\":[],\"ticket_types\":[{\"id\":\"6784f54ac4a80303833dadc7\",\"name\":\"Early Bowie Ticket\",\"description\":\"<p>● INCLUDES ONE TICKET, GIVING ENTRY FOR ONE PERSON, TO THE STALLS AND CIRCLE LEVELS OF THE VENUE</p><p>● PLEASE NOTE THAT THIS IS UNALLOCATED SEATING AND WORKS ON A FIRST COME, FIRST SERVED BASIS. STARTING FROM THE STALLS, THEN CIRCLE. PLEASE ARRIVE WITH YOUR GROUP TO ENSURE YOU CAN BE SAT IN THE SAME AREA</p><p>● THIS TICKET DOES NOT APPLY TO TABLES</p><p>● PLEASE ALL ARRIVE TOGETHER IN YOUR GROUP WITH YOUR TICKETS</p><p>ACTIVATED AND READY FOR SCANNING</p><p>● INCLUDES £1 VENUE RESTORATION LEVY</p>\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":5,\"remaining_quantity\":0,\"min_per_transaction\":0,\"max_per_transaction\":null,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":1350,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":true,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":5,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":5,\"total_ticket_attendees\":5,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":135,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}},{\"id\":\"67850147ae037f3a2361adf5\",\"name\":\"Hoggle Table for 4\",\"description\":\"<p>INCLUDES FOUR TICKETS GIVING ENTRY FOR FOUR PEOPLE, TO A TABLE ON THE STALLS OR CIRCLE LEVEL OF THE VENUE</p><p>IF YOU BOOK MULTIPLE TABLES, WE WILL TRY OUR BEST TO PUT YOU NEXT TO EACH BUT CANNOT ALWAYS GUARANTEE. PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ALL BUY TABLES ON THE SAME LEVEL AS EACH OTHER, IF SO.</p><p>PLEASE ALL ARRIVE TOGETHER IN YOUR GROUP WITH YOUR TICKETS ACTIVATED AND READY FOR SCANNING</p><p>INCLUDES £1 RESTORATION FEE</p><p>We hold all boxes and tables until an hour after doors open. Please notify us in advance if you’re running late as we will offer to other customers once the movie starts.</p>\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":44,\"remaining_quantity\":20,\"min_per_transaction\":4,\"max_per_transaction\":8,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":1850,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":false,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":44,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":24,\"total_ticket_attendees\":24,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":185,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}},{\"id\":\"678503b79fce5f633c4c10dd\",\"name\":\"General Admission\",\"description\":\"<p>● INCLUDES ONE TICKET, GIVING ENTRY FOR ONE PERSON, TO THE STALLS AND CIRCLE LEVELS OF THE VENUE</p><p>● PLEASE NOTE THAT THIS IS UNALLOCATED SEATING AND WORKS ON A FIRST COME, FIRST SERVED BASIS. STARTING FROM THE STALLS, THEN CIRCLE. PLEASE ARRIVE WITH YOUR GROUP TO ENSURE YOU CAN BE SAT IN THE SAME AREA</p><p>● THIS TICKET DOES NOT APPLY TO TABLES</p><p>● PLEASE ALL ARRIVE TOGETHER IN YOUR GROUP WITH YOUR TICKETS</p><p>ACTIVATED AND READY FOR SCANNING</p><p>● INCLUDES £1 VENUE RESTORATION LEVY</p>\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":84,\"remaining_quantity\":84,\"min_per_transaction\":0,\"max_per_transaction\":null,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":1600,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":false,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":84,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":0,\"total_ticket_attendees\":0,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":160,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}},{\"id\":\"6785042a1002f91761146118\",\"name\":\"A Royal Box (of Eternal Stench) for 3\",\"description\":\"<p>INCLUDES ENTRY FOR UP TO THREE PEOPLE, IN YOUR OWN PRIVATE BOX OVER OVERLOOKING THE STAGE</p><p>IF YOU BOOK MULTIPLE BOXES, WE WILL TRY OUR BEST TO PUT YOU NEXT TO EACH BUT CANNOT ALWAYS GUARANTEE</p><p>PLEASE ALL ARRIVE TOGETHER IN YOUR GROUP WITH YOUR TICKETS ACTIVATED AND READY FOR SCANNING</p><p>DUE TO THE ANGLE OF THE ROYAL BOX THERE MAY BE SOME SIGHTLINE ISSUES TO ANY VISUALS USED ON THE BACK OF THE STAGE</p><p>INCLUDES £1 RESTORATION FEE</p><p>We hold all boxes and tables until an hour after doors open. Please notify us in advance if you’re running late as we will offer to other customers once the movie starts.</p>\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":3,\"remaining_quantity\":0,\"min_per_transaction\":3,\"max_per_transaction\":3,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":1600,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":true,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":3,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":3,\"total_ticket_attendees\":3,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":160,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}},{\"id\":\"678504741002f917eb2fa463\",\"name\":\"A Royal Box (of Eternal Stench) for 4\",\"description\":\"<p>INCLUDES ENTRY FOR UP TO FOUR PEOPLE, IN YOUR OWN PRIVATE BOX OVER OVERLOOKING THE STAGE</p><p>IF YOU BOOK MULTIPLE BOXES, WE WILL TRY OUR BEST TO PUT YOU NEXT TO EACH BUT CANNOT ALWAYS GUARANTEE</p><p>PLEASE ALL ARRIVE TOGETHER IN YOUR GROUP WITH YOUR TICKETS ACTIVATED AND READY FOR SCANNING</p><p>DUE TO THE ANGLE OF THE ROYAL BOX THERE MAY BE SOME SIGHTLINE ISSUES TO ANY VISUALS USED ON THE BACK OF THE STAGE</p><p>INCLUDES £1 RESTORATION FEE</p><p>We hold all boxes and tables until an hour after doors open. Please notify us in advance if you’re running late as we will offer to other customers once the movie starts.</p>\",\"start_time\":\"18:00\",\"end_time\":\"22:30\",\"ticket_type_group\":null,\"available_quantity\":8,\"remaining_quantity\":0,\"min_per_transaction\":4,\"max_per_transaction\":4,\"fixed_quantities_per_purchase\":[],\"sell_until\":\"2026-01-09 17:00:00\",\"sell_from\":null,\"price\":{\"amount\":1600,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"is_sold_out\":true,\"bundle_ticket_type\":null,\"bundle_ticket_title\":null,\"custom_ticket_labels\":[],\"total_ticket_quota\":8,\"total_ticket_attendees_and_reservations\":8,\"total_ticket_attendees\":8,\"photo\":null,\"admin_fee\":{\"amount\":160,\"currency\":\"GBP\"},\"booking_fee\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\"}}]}],\"event\":{\"title\":\"Labyrinth Movie Night & Mini Bowie Disco\",\"photos\":[{\"_id\":\"688108a312ea3db2590f8db1\",\"path\":\"//static.designmynight.com/uploads/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-optimised.png\",\"caption\":\"\",\"thumbnail\":{\"file\":\"Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-140x72-optimised.png\",\"width\":140,\"height\":72},\"width_192\":{\"file\":\"Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-192x99-optimised.png\",\"width\":192,\"height\":99},\"small\":{\"file\":\"Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-300x154-optimised.png\",\"width\":300,\"height\":154},\"width_414\":{\"file\":\"Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-414x213-optimised.png\",\"width\":414,\"height\":213},\"medium\":{\"file\":\"Screenshot-2025-07-23-at-17.06.321-620x319-optimised.png\",\"width\":620,\"height\":319}},{\"_id\":\"68fb73d7723aab2d4130f07d\",\"path\":\"//static.designmynight.com/uplo